Here's a complete single-file site — save it as `index.html` and open it in a browser:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Punchline Parlour</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bungee&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #17120e;
    --gold: #ffb84d;
    --gold-deep: #d9932a;
    --cream: #fff6e3;
    --ink: #241a0e;
    --red: #ff5a3c;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--cream);
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 50% -10%, rgba(255,184,77,.10), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(800px 500px at 85% 110%, rgba(255,90,60,.08), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.04) 1px, transparent 1.5px),
      var(--bg);
    background-size: auto, auto, 22px 22px, auto;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ---------- spotlight that follows the mouse ---------- */
  .spot {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(320px 320px at var(--x,50%) var(--y,50%),
              rgba(255,190,110,.14), transparent 70%);
  }

  /* ---------- drifting sparkles ---------- */
  .spark {
    position: fixed; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    color: rgba(255,184,77,.5);
    animation: drift ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes drift {
    from { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); opacity: .25; }
    to   { transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(40deg); opacity: .9; }
  }

  /* ---------- scrolling marquee strip ---------- */
  .marquee {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255,184,77,.25);
  }
  .marquee-track {
    display: flex; width: max-content;
    animation: scroll 24s linear infinite;
  }
  .marquee span {
    font-family: 'Bungee', cursive; font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .2em; color: var(--gold);
    padding: 9px 0; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @keyframes scroll { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

  main {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 40px);
    padding: 30px 16px 40px;
  }

  /* ---------- the sign ---------- */
  .sign { text-align: center; width: 100%; max-width: 680px; }
  .bulbs {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    height: 14px;
  }
  .bulb {
    width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px 2px rgba(255,184,77,.8);
    animation: blink 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes blink { 0%,100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: .25; } }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Bungee', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: .02em;
    color: var(--cream);
    text-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--bg), 0 0 34px rgba(255,184,77,.35);
    margin: 14px 0 6px;
  }
  h1 .gold { color: var(--gold); }
  .tagline {
    font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,184,77,.85);
  }

  /* ---------- the joke card ---------- */
  .card {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%; max-width: 640px;
    margin: 30px auto 34px;
    background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 46px 40px 42px;
    transform: rotate(-.4deg);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5),
                0 0 0 4px var(--gold),
                inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
  }
  .card:hover {
    transform: rotate(-.1deg) translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 32px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55),
                0 0 0 4px var(--gold),
                0 0 40px rgba(255,184,77,.35),
                inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  }
  .card .bulbs { margin-bottom: 26px; }

  .bit-tag {
    position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 20px;
    font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em;
    color: var(--red);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
  }
  .bit-tag::before {
    content: ''; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red);
  }

  .setup {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.6vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .setup.in { animation: rise .5s ease forwards; }

  .punchline {
    font-family: 'Bungee', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3.4vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--red);
    margin-top: 22px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .punchline.in { animation: pop .55s .75s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.4) forwards; }

  .ha {
    position: absolute; right: 34px; bottom: 26px;
    font-family: 'Bungee', cursive; font-size: .95rem;
    background: var(--red); color: var(--cream);
    padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 8px;
    transform: rotate(8deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .ha.in { animation: haPop .45s .85s ease forwards; }

  @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes pop  { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.85) rotate(-2deg); }
                    60%  { transform: scale(1.06) rotate(1deg); }
                    to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) rotate(0); } }
  @keyframes haPop{ from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.4) rotate(-10deg); }
                    to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) rotate(8deg); } }

  /* ---------- the button ---------- */
  #jokeBtn {
    font-family: 'Bungee', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.2rem);
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--gold);
    border: none; cursor: pointer;
    padding: 18px 36px; border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 var(--gold-deep), 0 18px 40px rgba(255,184,77,.25);
    transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  #jokeBtn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 9px 0 var(--gold-deep), 0 24px 48px rgba(255,184,77,.35);
  }
  #jokeBtn:active {
    transform: translateY(3px);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--gold-deep), 0 10px 20px rgba(255,184,77,.25);
  }
  #jokeBtn:focus-visible { outline: 3px dashed var(--red); outline-offset: 4px; }

  /* ---------- footer meter ---------- */
  .foot {
    margin-top: 44px;
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px 28px;
    color: rgba(255,246,227,.6);
    font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .meter { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .stars span {
    font-size: 1.1rem; color: rgba(255,246,227,.2);
    transition: color .3s ease, transform .3s ease;
  }
  .stars span.on { color: var(--gold); transform: scale(1.2); }
  .note { color: rgba(255,246,227,.35); letter-spacing: .12em; }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .card { padding: 40px 24px 38px; }
    .ha { right: 20px; bottom: 20px; font-size: .8rem; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, *::before, *::after {
      animation-duration: .01ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
      transition-duration: .01ms !important;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="spot" id="spot"></div>
<div id="spark"></div>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <span>★ TONIGHT'S SPECIAL ★ FOUR BITS ★ NO REFUNDS ON LAUGHS ★ THE PUNCHLINE PARLOUR ★ </span>
    <span>★ TONIGHT'S SPECIAL ★ FOUR BITS ★ NO REFUNDS ON LAUGHS ★ THE PUNCHLINE PARLOUR ★ </span>
  </div>
</div>

<main>
  <header class="sign">
    <div class="bulbs" id="signBulbs" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h1>THE <span class="gold">PUNCHLINE</span><br>PARLOUR</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Four bits on the bill · no hecklers allowed</p>
  </header>

  <section class="card" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="bulbs" id="cardBulbs" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="bit-tag" id="bitTag">BIT —</div>
    <p class="setup" id="setup">Pull up a stool — the mic's warm.</p>
    <p class="punchline" id="punchline"></p>
    <div class="ha" id="ha">HA!</div>
  </section>

  <button id="jokeBtn">🎤 First bit →</button>

  <footer class="foot">
    <div class="meter">
      <span>Laugh-o-meter</span>
      <span class="stars" id="stars" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div id="count">Bits told: 0</div>
    <div class="note">★ est. tonight</div>
  </footer>
</main>

<script>
  const jokes = [
    { setup: "Why don't scientists trust atoms?",
      punch: "Because they make up everything." },
    { setup: "I told my wife she was drawing her eyebrows too high.",
      punch: "She looked surprised." },
    { setup: "Why did the scarecrow win an award?",
      punch: "Because he was outstanding in his field." },
    { setup: "I'm reading a book about anti-gravity.",
      punch: "It's impossible to put down." }
  ];

  const setupEl  = document.getElementById('setup');
  const punchEl  = document.getElementById('punchline');
  const haEl     = document.getElementById('ha');
  const bitTag   = document.getElementById('bitTag');
  const btn      = document.getElementById('jokeBtn');
  const countEl  = document.getElementById('count');
  const starsEl  = document.getElementById('stars');

  let last = -1, told = 0;

  // build the laugh-o-meter stars
  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) starsEl.appendChild(document.createElement('span'));

  // blink the marquee bulbs
  function makeBulbs(id, count) {
    const box = document.getElementById(id);
    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
      const b = document.createElement('span');
      b.className = 'bulb';
      b.style.animationDelay = (i * 0.12) + 's';
      box.appendChild(b);
    }
  }
  makeBulbs('signBulbs', 26);
  makeBulbs('cardBulbs', 20);

  // drifting sparkles
  const spark = document.getElementById('spark');
  for (let i = 0; i < 16; i++) {
    const s = document.createElement('span');
    s.className = 'spark';
    s.textContent = i % 2 ? '✦' : '✧';
    s.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
    s.style.top  = Math.random() * 100 + 'vh';
    s.style.fontSize = (8 + Math.random() * 10) + 'px';
    s.style.animationDuration = (4 + Math.random() * 6) + 's';
    s.style.animationDelay = (Math.random() * 6) + 's';
    spark.appendChild(s);
  }

  // spotlight follows the mouse (smoothed)
  const spot = document.getElementById('spot');
  let tx = innerWidth / 2, ty = innerHeight / 2, cx = tx, cy = ty;
  addEventListener('mousemove', e => { tx = e.clientX; ty = e.clientY; });
  (function loop() {
    cx += (tx - cx) * .12;
    cy += (ty - cy) * .12;
    spot.style.setProperty('--x', cx + 'px');
    spot.style.setProperty('--y', cy + 'px');
    requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  })();

  function tell() {
    let i;
    do { i = Math.floor(Math.random() * jokes.length); }
    while (i === last);          // never repeat the same bit twice
    last = i; told++;

    setupEl.textContent = jokes[i].setup;
    punchEl.textContent = jokes[i].punch;
    bitTag.textContent  = 'BIT ' + String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0') + ' / 04';

    // restart the reveal animations
    [setupEl, punchEl, haEl].forEach(el => {
      el.classList.remove('in');
      void el.offsetWidth;        // force reflow so the animation replays
      el.classList.add('in');
    });

    countEl.textContent = 'Bits told: ' + told;
    starsEl.children.forEach((s, n) => s.classList.toggle('on', n < told));

    if (told === 1) btn.textContent = '🎤 Another bit →';
  }

  btn.addEventListener('click', tell);
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

**How it works:**
- Clicking the button picks a random index from the 4-joke array, with a guard so the same joke never repeats back-to-back.
- The setup fades in first, then the punchline pops in ~750ms later with a bounce, plus a little "HA!" badge — so each joke feels like a real bit.
- Extras: a "Laugh-o-meter" that fills a star per joke, a bit counter, blinking marquee bulbs, a mouse-following spotlight, and a scrolling marquee strip.

To swap in your own jokes, just edit the `jokes` array at the top of the `<script>` block.

reasoning:
The user wants a simple HTML website: click a button → display a random joke from a list of 4 jokes. Simple, but I want to make it feel crafted and lively.

Let me think about the design. Joke site — what's the distinctive opening? Not a generic hero. A joke card, a "comedy club" vibe, or a punchline reveal with a typewriter/flip effect.

Design direction: comedy club / stand-up stage vibe. Dark stage? Or a bright, playful "joke card" aesthetic. Let me think of something distinctive:

Option A: "Comedy club" — dark stage, marquee lights, spotlight on the joke card, button like a "next bit" mic.
Option B: Bright, playful "joke card" — like a physical punchline card, bold typography, confetti on reveal.
Option C: Retro "punchline machine" — like a slot machine / typewriter.

I like the comedy club marquee idea: dark background with a warm spotlight, marquee bulbs, a big display typeface for the joke, a "Tell me another" button. Add a subtle animated marquee strip, a spotlight that follows the mouse, and a punchline reveal animation (setup fades in, then punchline pops in with a slight delay — this is a nice touch: display the setup, then after a beat the punchline appears).

Actually, the punchline reveal is a great micro-interaction: click → setup types/fades in → after ~700ms the punchline pops in with a scale/bounce. Plus a small "ha" confetti or starburst.

Typography: distinctive display face + readable body. Google Fonts: display "Bungee" or "Shrikhand" or "Fraunces"? For comedy: "Bungee" (marquee sign vibe) or "Lobster"? Bungee is very marquee-sign. Body: "Space Grotesk" or "Karla" or "Outfit". Let's go with Bungee for display + Karla or "Public Sans" for body. Actually "Bungee" + "Space Grotesk" is a good combo. Or "Shrikhand" is playful. Bungee feels like a comedy club marquee — good.

Palette: deep stage navy/charcoal with warm marquee gold/amber and a punchy red or coral accent. Warm gold on dark stage, with a spotlight. Layered background: subtle noise, radial spotlight, animated marquee bulbs, floating stars.

Layout: open with the marquee sign itself — "THE PUNCHLINE PARLOR" or "Joke Machine No. 4" — with a marquee bulb border, then the joke card (the stage), then the button. Not a hero trio.

Features:
- 4 jokes (setup + punchline).
- Button "Tell me another" — random, avoid repeating the same joke twice in a row.
- Punchline reveal: setup appears, punchline pops in after a delay with a bounce.
- Marquee bulbs around the card, animated.
- Spotlight that follows the mouse (radial gradient).
- Counter: "Bit #3 of 4" or a "rounds" counter.
- Subtle background: drifting stars/sparkles, or a faint pattern.
- Button hover: press effect, slight tilt; active state.
- Sound? No, keep it simple.
- A small "laugh meter" that fills up each time a joke is told? Cute: a row of stars that light up. Or a "ha-ha" counter. Let's add a small "bits told" counter and a laugh-o-meter (stars that fill up). Keep it tasteful.

Also add a marquee strip at the top: scrolling text "★ TONIGHT'S SPECIAL ★ 4 BITS ★ NO REFUNDS ON LAUGHS ★" — CSS animation.

Accessibility: aria-live on the joke area.

